 Intelligence, Natural Language Processing, and Interprocess communication. Having a robust assistant improves the time efficiency as well as reduces the efforts to perform simple repetitive tasks.","topics":[],"score":247314,"global_rank":67855,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12509},{"name":"kamal-hamza/Carpool","owner":"kamal-hamza","html_url":"https://github.com/kamal-hamza/Carpool","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Carpool Website with Django","topics":[],"score":247314,"global_rank":67856,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12510},{"name":"ianchen06/facebook_crawler","owner":"ianchen06","html_url":"https://github.com/ianchen06/facebook_crawler","stars":2,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A high performance Facebook fans page and public group crawler","topics":[],"score":247305,"global_rank":67869,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12511},{"name":"privatekenny/rotation","owner":"privatekenny","html_url":"https://github.com/privatekenny/rotation","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":247305,"global_rank":67871,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12512},{"name":"zeke-john/Cubes","owner":"zeke-john","html_url":"https://github.com/zeke-john/Cubes","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"calm lil cube game using opengl and pygame","topics":[],"score":247299,"global_rank":67883,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12513},{"name":"chrismgeorge/VAE-Animations","owner":"chrismgeorge","html_url":"https://github.com/chrismgeorge/VAE-Animations","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Using a Variational Autoencoder to generate an animations.","topics":[],"score":247296,"global_rank":67889,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12514},{"name":"rohit180497/Data-Encryption-Web-App","owner":"